# (AI-assisted) Jak II: jak2_title.pad (the intro scene title-disk-intro, no input, 3600 frames) then
# jak2_city.pad shifted by 2800 frames (continue ctysluma-start at 3800, the city-stand / city-walk
# perf windows). One emulator run for both; use with screenshots = 150 (config.ini) on the 3DS.
# The title part: on PC the scene ends on the JAK II logo over the slums; baseline B's 3DS (sound
# off) ended ~9 s in, in the title-movie-end view (*target* at (980, 85, 346) m: the pos line).
600 log perf-mark title
900 pos *target*
1800 pos *target*
3601 pos *target*
3602 log perf-mark title-end
3800 continue ctysluma-start
3801 -
3802 wait *target* target-stance
3803 log city: ctysluma-start
3804 pos *target*
4200 print *pad-script-mem*
4201 log perf-mark city-stand
4800 log perf-mark city-walk
4801 ly=0
5100 -
5101 log perf-mark end
5102 pos *target*
5103 print *target*
5200 exit
